      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLY OVER STATES (1) finished second at Riverina Paceway two runs ago before finishing sixth at his latest appearance over 1740m at Riverina Paceway, beaten 7 metres when sent out as the $3.60 favourite. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets a comparable field and he can make amends. ELLENS DELIGHT (2) after breaking in the score-up settled in the leading division then found the lead and fought on well to finish second last start over 1720m at Young, recording her second straight top-three placing. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position and is good enough to win a race of this calibre. EYES OFF TIGER (8) is right in contention after finishing in the placings for the second time in a row last start, beaten 2.5 metres into second at Young after racing in behind the leader at the bell. No reason he cannot take this out. BOY STUNNER (5) must be included on the back of some solid recent form, most recently when fourth at this track over 1770m.",
